  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nSeems like https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10869 changed the behavior, but I think the old behavior was less surprising for window.customElements users.\n\nhttps://whatpr.org/html/10869/d745538...9ad774d/custom-elements.html#custom-elements-api\n\nA testcase https://mozilla.pettay.fi/moztests/ce_registry.html\nGecko and Blink have the old behavior, Webkit the new.",
